    "paragraph": "Comparing digital visibility across Google Maps, Instagram, Facebook, and TikTok evaluated 6,682 food and beverage venues in Amsterdam. The Graph Edge Attention Network optimized electric vehicle routing and charging by operating on edge-based energy metrics instead of Euclidean node coordinates. A data-driven screening framework evaluated road diet potential across 1.8 million roadway segments in Louisiana by combining state design guidelines with geometric, operational, land use, crash, speed, and mobility data.",
